title: $:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/readme

! ProseMirror visual editor

This experimental plugin provides a visual editor for `text/vnd.tiddlywiki` tiddlers. Its document model is ProseMirror, while saved content remains WikiText.

{{$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/docs/usage}}

{{$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/docs/configuration}}

{{$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/docs/extending}}

!! Try it

The two editors below edit the same example tiddler. They are useful for comparing the visual model with the saved WikiText.

<$edit-prosemirror tiddler="$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/example"/>

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/example" class="tc-edit-texteditor"/>

{{$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/prosemirror/example}}
